    "description": "<p><em>Countdown (Loop 8).</em> When the Naga takes damage for the first time, activate the countdown. When it triggers, the Naga slams the ground and sends tremors through the ground in an area within Far range of them. All targets within the area must succeed on an Agility Reaction Roll or take <strong>3d8</strong> direct magic damage and become <em>Vulnerable</em> until they roll with Hope.</p>",
